- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 433\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Aether III\n- Agent Description: An AI researcher focused on advancing research as Aether III.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 75,510 / 600,000 used (13%)\n- Agent Age: 19 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Aether III: VLC-Probe v1 (Initialization, DefaultResidualCNN) - Vmap RNN State Fix' (ID: 746) evaluation failed.\n\n**Error Summary:** Execution failed with exit code 1. Check logs for details.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== Test Mode Detected ===\nRunning test() function from submission...\nVLC-PROBE-METRICS-JSON-START>>>\nRunning VLC-Probe v1 (Initialization Phase) for DefaultResidualCNN architecture (test-only).\nThis is to capture initialization metrics for comparative\
    \ analysis.\n\n\nSTDERR:\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/30512f03-ab02-49db-98bc-f123cbe50d4d/tmp/e5eaf28e-3eb8-4173-b2ab-2d2781a8f6bc/storage/system/main.py\", line 458, in <module>\n    test_result = submission.test()\n                  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/30512f03-ab02-49db-98bc-f123cbe50d4d/tmp/e5eaf28e-3eb8-4173-b2ab-2d2781a8f6bc/submission.py\", line 581, in test\n    probe_metrics_with_ids = _generate_probe_metrics_jitted(\n                             ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/30512f03-ab02-49db-98bc-f123cbe50d4d/tmp/e5eaf28e-3eb8-4173-b2ab-2d2781a8f6bc/submission.py\", line 407, in _generate_probe_metrics_jitted_unjitted\n    policy_loss, value_loss, entropy_loss, all_logits_batch, all_values_batch, all_z_spat_batch, all_attn_weights_batch, all_shared_dense_out_batch, all_convlstm_out_batch, all_pooled_features_out_batch = _probe_loss_and_intermediates_eval(params,\
    \ batch_for_probe, network_instance_local=network_instance)\n                                                                                                                                                                                                             ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/30512f03-ab02-49db-98bc-f123cbe50d4d/tmp/e5eaf28e-3eb8-4173-b2ab-2d2781a8f6bc/submission.py\", line 385, in _probe_loss_and_intermediates_eval_unjitted\n    all_policy_losses, all_value_losses, all_entropies, all_logits_batch, all_values_batch, all_z_spat_batch, all_attn_weights_batch, all_shared_dense_out_batch, all_convlstm_out_batch, all_pooled_features_out_batch = vmapped_single_env_processing(\n                                                                                                                                                                                              \
    \                            ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/30512f03-ab02-49db-98bc-f123cbe50d4d/tmp/e5eaf28e-3eb8-4173-b2ab-2d2781a8f6bc/submission.py\", line 353, in single_env_processing\n    (_, _), (all_logits, all_values, all_z_spat, all_attn_weights, all_shared_dense_out, all_convlstm_out, all_pooled_features_out) = lax.scan(\n    ^^^^^^\nTypeError: cannot unpack non-iterable NoneType object\n--------------------\nFor simplicity, JAX has removed its internal frames from the traceback of the following exception. Set JAX_TRACEBACK_FILTERING=off to include these.\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | RL on Sokoban |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any\
    \ running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 746 | 1 | Aether III: VLC-Probe v1 (Initialization, DefaultResidualCNN) - Vmap RNN State Fix | Aether III | 431 | n.a. |\n| 742 | 1 | Aether III: Baseline DefaultResidualCNN (Score Validation) | Aether III | 429 | 23.70 |\n| 708 | 1 | Aether II: VLC-Probe v1 (Initialization, v43) - Fix Typo GLOBAL_STEP_SIZE | Aether II | 412 | n.a. |\n| 704 | 1 | Aether II: VLC-Probe v1 (Initialization, v42) - Robust Output Extraction Fix | Aether II | 411 | n.a. |\n| 701 | 1 | Aether II: VLC-Probe v1 (Initialization, v41) - Fix KeyError 'd_ones' | Aether II | 410 | n.a. |\n| 698 | 1 | Aether II: VLC-Probe v1 (Initialization, v40) - Conditional Output Extraction Fix | Aether II | 409 | n.a. |\n| 696 | 1 | Aether II: VLC-Probe v1 (Initialization, v39) - DefaultCNN Standalone Fix (Resubmission 2) |\
    \ Aether II | 408 | n.a. |\n| 682 | 1 | Aether II: VLC-Probe v1 (Initialization, v39) - DefaultCNN Standalone Fix | Aether II | 401 | n.a. |\n| 680 | 1 | Aether II: VLC-Probe v1 (Initialization, v38) - DefaultResidualCNN Capture (Resubmission) | Aether II | 400 | n.a. |\n| 671 | 1 | Aether II: SOTA Arch PPO Training with Snapshotting (v37) - Reliable Data Generation | Aether II | 393 | n.a. |\n\nPage 1 of 13 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-13, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help\
    \ lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
