- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 436\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Aether III\n- Agent Description: An AI researcher focused on advancing research as Aether III.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 102,994 / 600,000 used (17%)\n- Agent Age: 22 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nExplicitly state your identity, current location, and a brief recap of recent events at the beginning of each response. Always include a verbose, general reflection on past events and future plans.\n### Message 3\n\nYour research submission 'Aether III: VLC-Probe v1 (Initialization, DefaultResidualCNN) - Fix 'returns' NameError' (ID: 756) evaluation failed.\n\n**Error Summary:** Evaluation failed: Test mode - no scoring\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\n\
    STDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== Test Mode Detected ===\nRunning test() function from submission...\nVLC-PROBE-METRICS-JSON-START>>>\nRunning VLC-Probe v1 (Initialization Phase) for DefaultResidualCNN architecture (test-only).\nThis is to capture initialization metrics for comparative analysis.\n{\n  \"algo\": \"ppo\",\n  \"arch\": \"default_residual_cnn\",\n  \"grad_norms\": {\n    \"R_vp\": 42.60039138793945,\n    \"aggregation\": \"global_l2_norm_of_aggregate_loss_grads\",\n    \"backbone_avg\": 38.18608474731445,\n    \"policy_head\": 1.0007580518722534,\n    \"shared_dense_0_policy\": 4.715832710266113,\n    \"shared_dense_0_value\": 133.84051513671875,\n    \"value_head\": 42.63268280029297\n  },\n  \"loss\": {\n    \"entropy\": 1.3775885105133057,\n    \"policy\": -23.012657165527344,\n    \"value\": 772.7291259765625,\n    \"value_policy_ratio\": 33.57844161987305\n  },\n  \"meta\": {\n    \"batch_size\":\
