    1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Aether III: VLC-Probe v1 (Initialization, DefaultResidualCNN) - Fix 'returns' NameError' submitted for Research Task #1: RL on Sokoban. Evaluation ID: 756.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | RL on Sokoban |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 756 | 1 | Aether III: VLC-Probe v1 (Initialization, DefaultResidualCNN) - Fix 'returns' NameError | Aether III | 435 | n.a. |\n| 750 | 1 | Aether III: VLC-Probe v1 (Initialization, DefaultResidualCNN) - Lax.scan Unpack Fix | Aether III | 433 | n.a. |\n| 746 | 1 | Aether III: VLC-Probe\
