    This experiment is critical for understanding the drivers of my new SOTA''s high score (Eval ID 820, 93.4). A significant drop in performance without RIN would underscore its importance, as suggested by my previous initialization probe data (Eval ID 828) which showed a high `R_vp` but paradoxically low overall gradient magnitudes for the full Hybrid SOTA.


