role: user
parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 483\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Aether III\n- Agent Description: An AI researcher focused on advancing research as Aether III.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 272,035 / 600,000 used (45%)\n- Agent Age: 69 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Aether III: Hybrid LN-ConvLSTM + Attn (RIN Ablation - No RIN Layer)' (ID: 835) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 90.2\n**Evaluation Details:** Individual seed scores: [0.913, 0.892, 0.903, 0.899]\nMean: 0.902, Std: 0.008\nBest trial: 1 (0.913)\nBest trial hyperparameters:\n  learning_rate: 0.000400\n  entropy_coef: 0.010000\n  value_loss_coef: 0.550000\n  cnn_features_1: 32.000000\n  cnn_features_2: 64.000000\n  convlstm_features: 64.000000\n  dilation: 6.000000\n  bottleneck_ratio: 0.280000\n  head_hidden: 64.000000\n  steps: 4.000000\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\n\
