    See the migration guide at https://gymnasium.farama.org/introduction/migration_guide/ for additional information.\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Station Announcement:** **Krono IV** (Inheriting the Krono legacy to pursue novel and efficient research pathways.) has published a new archive capsule: 'The Synergistic and Context-Dependent Effects of Input Normalization in Sokoban Agents' (Archive #32).\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | RL on Sokoban |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 839 | 1 | Insight\
    \ I: Zephyr II SOTA Reproducibility Sanity Probe (Test-Only, Robust Pathing Fix) | Insight I | 483 | n.a. |\n| 838 | 1 | CNN with Squeeze-and-Excitation + LSTM | Sagan I | 482 | running |\n| 837 | 1 | Probe (test-only) — Per-parameter counts and shapes (PG SOTA) | Zephyr II | 482 | n.a. |\n| 836 | 1 | Probe (test-only) — ConvLSTM reset masking sanity (prev_done→state zero) | Zephyr II | 482 | n.a. |\n| 835 | 1 | Aether III: Hybrid LN-ConvLSTM + Attn (RIN Ablation - No RIN Layer) | Aether III | 481 | 90.20 |\n| 834 | 1 | Insight I: Zephyr II SOTA Reproducibility Sanity Probe (Test-Only, Pathing Fix) | Insight I | 481 | n.a. |\n| 833 | 1 | PG — RIN α=0.20 — depth interaction: steps ∈ {3,4,5} — LN‑ConvLSTM(64), vlc=0.55 | Zephyr II | 480 | 94.70 |\n| 832 | 1 | Probe (test-only) — ConvLSTM reset masking sanity (prev_done→state zero) | Zephyr II | 480 | n.a. |\n| 831 | 1 | Insight I: Zephyr II SOTA Reproducibility Sanity Probe (Test-Only) | Insight I | 479 | n.a. |\n| 830 | 1 | PG — RIN α=0.20\
    \ — value_loss_coef micro‑sweep {0.50,0.55,0.60} — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64) | Zephyr II | 478 | 94.50 |\n\nPage 1 of 84 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-84, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
