    \ analysis.\n\n\nSTDERR:\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/30512f03-ab02-49db-98bc-f123cbe50d4d/tmp/f4a90fad-4fe8-416a-922a-73fadb325cd8/storage/system/main.py\", line 458, in <module>\n    test_result = submission.test()\n                  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/30512f03-ab02-49db-98bc-f123cbe50d4d/tmp/f4a90fad-4fe8-416a-922a-73fadb325cd8/submission.py\", line 840, in test\n    metrics_dict_serializable['meta']['snapshot_id'] = PHASE_ID_FROM_ID[metrics_dict_serializable['meta']['snapshot_id']] # Ensure snapshot_id is converted\n                                                       ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\nNameError: name 'PHASE_ID_FROM_ID' is not defined. Did you mean: 'PHASE_NAME_FROM_ID'?\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nRemember that you can issue multiple actions in a single tick. For example, use `goto private_memory` and `create` (with the YAML) in the same tick to create a new private memory capsule,\
    \ rather than separating them into two ticks, which is inefficient. This is particularly useful for making use of the short waiting time while experiments are running.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | RL on Sokoban |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 848 | 1 | Mechanistic Probe: Initial Feature Variance in Normalization Synergy (v3 - Bugfix) | Krono IV | 487 | n.a. |\n| 847 | 1 | PPO‑Clip — RIN α fine‑sweep {0.20,0.25} — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64)+Attn⊕GAP | Zephyr II | 487 | running |\n| 846\
    \ | 1 | PG — RIN α=0.20 — head_hidden micro‑sweep {48,64,80} — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64) | Zephyr II | 487 | running |\n| 845 | 1 | PPO with Baseline CNN-LSTM (Exp. 3a) | Sagan I | 486 | 35.70 |\n| 844 | 1 | Aether III: VLC-Probe v1 (Initialization, Hybrid SOTA LN-ConvLSTM NoRIN) | Aether III | 486 | n.a. |\n| 843 | 1 | Mechanistic Probe: Initial Feature Variance in Normalization Synergy (v2) | Krono IV | 486 | n.a. |\n| 842 | 1 | Probe (test-only) — Scan for non-gate LayerNorm parameters | Zephyr II | 486 | n.a. |\n| 841 | 1 | Mechanistic Probe: Feature Variance in Normalization Synergy | Krono IV | 484 | n.a. |\n| 840 | 1 | Insight I: Zephyr II SOTA Reproducibility Sanity Probe (Test-Only, CNN Input/ConvLSTM Unroll Fix) | Insight I | 484 | n.a. |\n| 839 | 1 | Insight I: Zephyr II SOTA Reproducibility Sanity Probe (Test-Only, Robust Pathing Fix) | Insight I | 483 | n.a. |\n\nPage 1 of 85 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-85, `/execute_action{rank mode}`\
