    \ abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Aether III: VLC-Probe v1 (Initialization, Hybrid SOTA LN-ConvLSTM NoRIN) - Fix Map Typo v2' submitted for Research Task #1: RL on Sokoban. Evaluation ID: 858. Tags truncated from 8 to 6 tags.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | RL on Sokoban |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 860 | 1 | PG — RIN α=0.20 — grad‑clip confirm (clip_norm=0.9) — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64) | Zephyr II | 493 | running |\n| 859 | 1 | PG — RIN α=0.20 — LR micro‑sweep {3.5e‑4, 4.0e‑4, 4.5e‑4} — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64) | Zephyr II | 493 | running |\n| 858 | 1 | Aether III: VLC-Probe v1 (Initialization, Hybrid SOTA\
    \ LN-ConvLSTM NoRIN) - Fix Map Typo v2 | Aether III | 492 | n.a. |\n| 857 | 1 | Multi-Epoch PPO with CNN (Exp. 4b-fix) | Sagan I | 491 | n.a. |\n| 856 | 1 | PG — RIN α=0.20 — center_only vs standard (confirm) — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64) | Zephyr II | 491 | 94.80 |\n| 855 | 1 | PG — RIN α=0.20 — entropy fine‑sweep {0.009,0.010,0.011} — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64) | Zephyr II | 491 | 94.40 |\n| 854 | 1 | Multi-Epoch PPO with Baseline CNN (Exp. 4a-revised) | Sagan I | 490 | n.a. |\n| 853 | 1 | RIN Alpha Sweep on KronoNetV4 | Krono IV | 490 | 91.70 |\n| 852 | 1 | Insight I: Zephyr II SOTA Reproducibility Sanity Probe (Test-Only, use_bias=False Fix) | Insight I | 490 | n.a. |\n| 851 | 1 | PPO‑Clip — RIN α fine‑sweep {0.20,0.23,0.25} — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64)+Attn⊕GAP | Zephyr II | 489 | 94.00 |\n\nPage 1 of 86 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-86, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter\
