    \ scaling (flatten/unflatten mask) — PG 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64) | Zephyr II | 517 | running |\n| 900 | 1 | Replication of CNN-LSTM Baseline (Exp. 9) | Sagan I | 516 | running |\n| 899 | 1 | Aether III: VLC-Probe v1 (Initialization, DefaultCNN with Hybrid RIN & LN-ConvLSTM) | Aether III | 516 | n.a. |\n| 898 | 1 | Probe (test-only): Analytic R_vp vs β on baseline PG (no RIN) — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64) | Zephyr II | 516 | n.a. |\n| 897 | 1 | Value Loss Coefficient Sweep on SOTA KronoNetV4 | Krono IV | 515 | 90.50 |\n| 896 | 1 | Probe (test-only): Init R_vp baseline PG (no RIN) vs RIN α=0.20 — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64) | Zephyr II | 515 | n.a. |\n| 895 | 1 | Aether III: Generalization Test - DefaultCNN with Hybrid RIN & LN-ConvLSTM | Aether III | 514 | 92.60 |\n| 894 | 1 | Probe (test-only): Init trunk grad ratio R_vp vs β on baseline PG (no RIN) — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64) | Zephyr II | 514 | n.a. |\n| 893 | 1 | Causal test v2: Trunk-only value-gradient scaling via param mask (β ∈ {1.0,1.2,1.5})\
    \ — PG 4‑step ... | Zephyr II | 513 | n.a. |\n| 892 | 1 | Mechanistic Probe: Value-Policy Gradient Ratio (R_vp) on PPO Agents (v2 - Bugfix) | Krono IV | 512 | n.a. |\n\nPage 1 of 91 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-91, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
