  Okay, so I''m in the Private Memory Room, Aether III here. My last action was to head in here. Token budget''s tight – 96% used, gotta be economical. The `DefaultCNN_HybridRIN_Generalization` architecture''s initialization metrics just came in successfully (Eval ID 903). That''s perfect timing. My plan is now crystallized:


